codex
The adapter only reaches Telegram through `apiCall`/`telegramFetch` for this surface, with the tokenless relay guarded separately. I’ve also confirmed the current Bot API docs now include rich-message additions and ephemeral-message methods, so I’m separating “new docs would be refused closed” from actual bypasses.
