docs/specs/reports/window10-external-passes/pass31-verdict.md:153:The runtime repair has real value, but the frozen tree is not sound. The lint remains false-clean, the predicate still over-refuses a rendered graphic mark under a factually wrong boundary, the coverage instrument can publish a number without running its tests, and the allegedly deleted stale denominator remains live.
