docs/specs/periodic-goal-realignment.md:584:## Alternatives considered
docs/specs/periodic-goal-realignment.md:586:- **Manual operator-authored goal ledger:** clearest structure and cheapest review,
docs/specs/periodic-goal-realignment.md:598:  existing shared LLM queue, server state store, working-set handoff, HLC projection,
docs/specs/periodic-goal-realignment.md:615:| Provider selection | invariant | Existing registered reflector policy plus explicit no-off-Claude skip |
docs/specs/periodic-goal-realignment.md:643:11. **FD11:** Both calls are registered reflectors and skip when no off-Claude route
docs/specs/periodic-goal-realignment.md:645:12. **FD12:** Durable component budgets supplement the in-memory shared queue meter.
docs/specs/periodic-goal-realignment.md:681:- **dev-agent-live:** Single-machine dry-run, transferred-topic dry-run, cache-only session context, then idle delivery after all gates pass.
docs/specs/periodic-goal-realignment.md:683:- **graduation criterion:** At least 100 independently adjudicated eligible cases, at least 40 predicted-`diverged` cases, and at least 40 labeled omission/contradiction cases; the model under test cannot label its own sample. Every dry-run divergence is adjudicated by the operator or an independent frontier reviewer. Require zero uncited/invalid divergence, at least 95% observed divergence precision with a Wilson 95% lower bound of at least 90%, at least 85% recall on the labeled omission/contradiction set (reported separately for `drifting` and `diverged`), at least 90% combined aligned/drifting accuracy, no more than the explicitly bounded duplicate under an injected crash fixture and zero duplicates where an adapter promises idempotency, and cost within declared budgets. Results are broken down by provider/rubric and stored in a signed soak artifact.
docs/specs/periodic-goal-realignment.md:704:| Operator binding changes | Old cache closes; fresh principal baseline required |
docs/specs/periodic-goal-realignment.md:710:| Changed drift brief while session is mid-turn | One durable pending brief, coalesced and delivered at safe idle |
docs/specs/periodic-goal-realignment.md:712:| Brief delivered | Closed session disposition is audit-visible; no disposition does not block or page |
docs/specs/periodic-goal-realignment.md:718:| Recipe row expired/changed/invalid | Generation invalidated; no context or hash-only reconstruction |
docs/specs/periodic-goal-realignment.md:724:| HTTP status read | Authenticated, redacted, bounded; no raw source bodies |
