docs/specs/reports/window12-laptop/precedence-verify.out:49:   *Self-Heal Before Notify* supplies the missing scope predicate:
docs/specs/reports/window12-laptop/precedence-verify.out:57:   *Never a False Blocker* identifies an intrinsically physical act as something the agent cannot perform. *Mobile-Complete* repeatedly scopes itself to an “operator-facing route,” approval surface, grant, credential submission, decision, or PIN-gated authority—software interactions introduced or touched by the feature. A hardware reset is not an API-only operator route that could have been given a phone UI. The agent may ask the operator to press the button; any digital approval or supporting interface must remain phone-completable.
docs/specs/reports/window12-laptop/precedence-verify.out:65:- both scope predicates apply;
docs/specs/reports/window12-laptop/precedence-verify.out:79:A safe interim would preserve ratification status, express governing declarations, scope predicates, named exceptions, and explicit composition clauses, escalating only after those mechanisms genuinely fail to decide the case.
