docs/specs/reports/window12-laptop/substrate-r4.out:13:7. Self-Unblock Before Escalating — Ordered vault, cloud, MCP, browser, and resource probes cost about 5–30 minutes for a routine blocker and potentially hours, before every ordinary escalation. Common case: an operator can identify a non-secret configuration location in ten seconds. “Every path” lacks a timebox, expected-value cutoff, confidence threshold, or parallel ask-and-search option. The checklist ships dark, so expensive search is still silently shortcuttable.
docs/specs/reports/window12-laptop/substrate-r4.out:16:10. A Dispatch Supplies the Question and Withholds the Answer — Independent grounding adds roughly 2–10 minutes and 500–3,000 tokens to every delegated check. Common case: a mechanical conformance test compares migration output with an approved expected array; withholding that oracle forces duplicate research and can reduce correctness. The rule lacks a discovery-versus-conformance discriminator. Ad-hoc oracle-bearing dispatches remain invisible to its template lint.
