docs/specs/reports/window12-laptop/substrate-r3.out:9:2. A Dispatch Supplies the Question and Withholds the Answer — The lint observes boilerplate, not whether the actual question plants an answer — a template includes the marker and all three required instructions, then states “the symptom is evaluated on every outbound message” as fact and anchors the reviewer while passing lint.
docs/specs/reports/window12-laptop/substrate-r3.out:12:5. Deferral = Deletion — The CI surface observes an identifier occurrence, not whether the deferred work was preserved or completed — an agent adds `CMT-1234`, mentions it in executable test content, abandons the work, and receives a green referent check.
docs/specs/reports/window12-laptop/substrate-r3.out:13:6. The Body and the Mind — The proposed guard can observe a declared decision class but not whether that classification is truthful — an author labels a request-dependent machine-selection route `invariant`; structure makes the consequential choice and the declaration still passes.
docs/specs/reports/window12-laptop/substrate-r3.out:17:10. Remove What Demands Attention. Do Not Supply More Attention. — Its lint observes duplicate structured definitions only, not duplicated facts in prose — an agent copies the same count into two differently worded paragraphs, leaves one stale, and cites the green duplicate-definition lint.
docs/specs/reports/window12-laptop/substrate-r3.out:20:13. Close the Loop — No surface enumerates all opened loops or verifies that a registered cadence actually resurfaces them — an agent creates a cadence row for a promise, leaves its scheduler disabled, and cites registration while the promise never returns.
